{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Howdy, and welcome to Get'Trump'ed, the ultimate trivia showdown where Donald Trump\u2019s larger-than-life persona takes center stage! Dive into a hilarious mix of questions about his boasts, policies, and epic feuds with figures like Biden, Pelosi, and Musk. With a satirical twist, challenge yourself on MAGA victories, mock wasteful &quot;woke&quot; USAID spending, and uncover absurd moments that only Trump could inspire.<br><i></i><br><i>Trump is on message daily, have you been paying attention? It's time to take the test.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay: Face 100+ quirky questions with strategic wildcards, aiming for high scores to unlock 25 cartoon-style achievements featuring political and social icons and Trump\u2019s wild world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features: Single-player mode with random difficulty, fun visuals, a patriotic soundtrack and many TRUMPISM that\u2019ll have you cheering.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tone: A lighthearted, pro-Trump romp\u2014ideal for fans and enemies who love a laugh and a jab at the establishment.<br><br><br>Music by UDIO<br>Meshy used for Models</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Lose -1 Games Angry Trump","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3588390/9c6f5376ee22a4ebb98ab7ad03aebe38a08962ed.jpg"},{"name":"Win 1 Game Happy Trump","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3588390/b45e44b95a56b356b8300e621f470aea2fd51157.jpg"},{"name":"Win 2 Games Gulf of America","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3588390/370f5f2d1c56da2cfd3e10ce19e80f7b57179551.jpg"},{"name":"Win_3_Games_Elon_Musk","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3588390/75530069291e3877dcb5bbd7c7fca27f6